	(text "- The board's size and hole positions: from the climate-unit mock-up (Y14), provisional until V-102 / V-113 and F11 (R11).\n- The DT13-12PA footprint is the carrier's (pin numbering and the flange-to-edge 4 mm are confirm there).\n- The inside leads (P196) and their lengths; the plate cable (P200) and its length.\n- No capacitor at DP-DCU-E: the panel board's C1 (10 uF) sits at its own +5V_PNL entry and the plate carries its driver's." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 245 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "363cc663-5d43-58f9-9cb1-95cca29ba759"))
